    Encoder PPR = 7 on the MOTOR shaft (before gearbox).
    
    So: output 750 RPM → wheel speed = 750/60 × π×34 = 12.5 × 106.81 = 1335 mm/s max
    Counts per wheel rev = 7 × 4 × 30 = 840 (encoder on motor shaft × quadrature × gear)
    mm per count = π × 34 / 840 = 0.12723 mm
    
    Verify: at 750 RPM output, counts/sec = 750/60 × 840 = 10,500 counts/sec
    speed = 10500 × 0.12723 = 1335 mm/s ✓ consistent

